 Originally, I was going to try and hand paint the MatCap sphere in Photoshop. However, after searching for areas in the skin tone that would give me a pretty good range to use, it turns out the spherical curve of the buttocks in this particular image exhibited the exact range I was looking for.The selected region was circle cropped,Gaussian Blur applied, and Curves adjusted to give it some more contrast, then exported as a JPEG. 



